  title: Harvest drought
  speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f9aada79e4b64c4e9df2ba49fcc84f7, type: 2}
  eventType: 1
  descriptionDialogue:
  - 'In the recent months, the fields have seen less water than my body - food will
    be short this year. '
  - Unless you have some bright idea, Sir Advisor?
  isKingEvent: 0
  choices:
  - choiceText: 'Accept fate. '
    responseToChoice: Let's hope our storages are full enough...
    consequences: []
